            "name": "Fuel & Rest stop",
            "category": "Service",
            "notes": "Floating fuel barge operated by local fishermen co-op. Diesel only. Fresh coconuts sold by longtail.",
            "icon": "\u26fd",
            "hours": "07:00\u201315:00 (not always staffed)"
          }
        }
      ]
